# Kitchen Finks and counter annihilation (CR 704.5q, 702.79a): Finks persists once and comes back with a -1/-1 counter. On
# turn 5 Bot1's Snakeskin Veil puts a +1/+1 counter on it, and the next state-based action check removes one of each, so it
# has no counters: a 3/2 again. Bolted on turn 6 (its hexproof was until the end of turn 5), it dies with no -1/-1 counter
# and persists again. Bot1 gains 2 life on each of its three entries.

